    {"type":"identity","id":"id_ch2_7_cauchy_square","number":"(7)","name_en":"Vanishing integral of the square of the analytic projection","name_zh":"解析投影平方积分为零","anchor":{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":52},"formula":"(1/2π)∫_0^{2π}(F(e^{iθ}))^2 dθ = 0","notes_zh":"取实部可恢复共轭函数的 L^2 恒等式；把 F^2 替换为 F^{2k} 是 Riesz 方法的早期动机。"},
    {"type":"theorem","id":"thm_ch2_2_1_riesz_interpolation","number":"2.1","name_en":"Riesz interpolation theorem","name_zh":"Riesz 插值定理","anchor":{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":52},"core_statement_zh":"若线性算子 T 在 (p0,q0) 与 (p1,q1) 两个端点分别有界，则对 0≤t≤1，令 1/p=(1-t)/p0+t/p1、1/q=(1-t)/q0+t/q1，有 ||T f||_q≤M||f||_p，且 M≤M0^{1-t}M1^t。","formula":"1/p=(1-t)/p0+t/p1; 1/q=(1-t)/q0+t/q1; M≤M0^{1-t}M1^t"},
    {"type":"figure","id":"fig_ch2_2_strip_phi","number":"Figure 2","name_en":"The domain of the function Φ","name_zh":"函数 Φ 的条带区域","anchor":{"pdf_page":72,"printed_page":53},"asset_policy":"retain_original_pdf_figure","notes_zh":"展示复平面条带 Re(z)=0 与 Re(z)=1，以及内部插值位置 t。"},
    {"type":"lemma","id":"lemma_ch2_2_2_three_lines","number":"2.2","name_en":"Three-lines lemma","name_zh":"三线引理","anchor":{"pdf_page":72,"printed_page":53},"core_statement_zh":"若 Φ 在 0<Re(z)<1 内全纯，并在闭条带上连续有界；边界线上的上界为 M0、M1，则内部线 Re(z)=t 上有 |Φ|≤M0^{1-t}M1^t。"},
    {"type":"proof_device","id":"device_ch2_analytic_family_fz_gz","name_en":"Analytic families f_z and g_z","name_zh":"插值证明中的解析族 f_z、g_z","anchor":{"pdf_page":74,"printed_page":55},"notes_zh":"把简单函数 f、g 的幂指数做成 z 的线性函数，使 z=t 时回到目标指数，而两条边界线恰好落到两个已知端点。"},
    {"type":"definition","id":"def_ch2_type_pq","name_en":"Operator of type (p,q)","name_zh":"(p,q) 型算子","anchor":{"pdf_page":75,"printed_page":56},"core_statement_zh":"若对所有简单函数 f 有 ||T(f)||_q≤M||f||_p，则称 T 为 (p,q) 型。"},
    {"type":"definition","id":"def_ch2_riesz_diagram","name_en":"Riesz diagram","name_zh":"Riesz 图","anchor":{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":57},"core_statement_zh":"把 T 为 (p,q) 型的指数对映为单位方形中的点 (1/p,1/q)，所有这类点组成 T 的 Riesz 图。"},
    {"type":"corollary","id":"cor_ch2_2_3_riesz_diagram_convex","number":"2.3","name_en":"Convexity of the Riesz diagram","name_zh":"Riesz 图的凸性","anchor":{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":57},"core_statement_zh":"Riesz 图是凸集；最佳常数 M_{x,y} 的对数 log M_{x,y} 在该图上为凸函数。"},
    {"type":"corollary","id":"cor_ch2_2_4_hausdorff_young","number":"2.4","name_en":"Hausdorff-Young inequality for Fourier coefficients","name_zh":"Fourier 系数的 Hausdorff-Young 不等式","anchor":{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":57},"formula":"||{a_n}||_{L^q(Z)}≤||f||_{L^p([0,2π])}, 1≤p≤2, 1/p+1/q=1"},
    {"type":"corollary","id":"cor_ch2_2_5_dual_hausdorff_young","number":"2.5","name_en":"Dual Hausdorff-Young inequality","name_zh":"Hausdorff-Young 对偶不等式","anchor":{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":58},"formula":"||Σ a_n e^{inθ}||_{L^q([0,2π])}≤||{a_n}||_{L^p(Z)}, 1≤p≤2"},
    {"type":"corollary","id":"cor_ch2_2_6_fourier_transform_hy","number":"2.6","name_en":"Hausdorff-Young inequality for the Fourier transform","name_zh":"Fourier 变换的 Hausdorff-Young 不等式","anchor":{"pdf_page":78,"printed_page":59},"formula":"||T(f)||_{L^q(R^d)}≤||f||_{L^p(R^d)}, 1≤p≤2, 1/p+1/q=1"},
